{
    "version": 6,
    "bundle": "MRXGBQ53RKUULEPJZNQBGSR3UOF32UKX",
    "type": "story",
    "storyId": "041112001",
    "title": "Ready for Heart?",
    "enTitle": "",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "大量の資料を抱え、トレーナー室への道を急ぐ。",
            "enText": "Carrying a large stack of documents, \nI make my way toward the trainers' offices.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 73,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（スカウト候補、今日こそ決められるかな）",
                    "enText": "(Will I finally make my decision today?)",
                    "nextBlock": 2
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3220902068538018512,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "新人トレーナーゆえの不安から、準備ばかりに時間をかけ……\nウマ娘に声をかけることすら、なかなかできなかった。",
            "enText": "Burdened by all the worries of a novice trainer, \nI ended up spending all my time just preparing…… \nI just couldn't bring myself to even speak to an Uma Musume.",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 115,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（俺って……本当に、小心者だな）",
                    "enText": "(I'm……just a coward)",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "（私って……本当に、小心者だな）",
                    "enText": "(I'm……just a coward)",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2182679285629386534,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "――その時、賑やかな声が聞こえてきた。",
            "enText": "――At that moment, I heard light-hearted voices.",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 69,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": 6037933446859556516,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハートの友人A",
            "enName": "Heart's Friend A",
            "jpText": "ランチタイムに、いきなりチア！？\nでもさすがハートだよね、めっちゃ人集まってきた～っ！！",
            "enText": "At lunch time, suddenly getting a cheer going!? But I guess \nthat's just like Heart, and look at how many people showed up～!!",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 207,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -8371385124336418011,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ハートの友人B",
            "enName": "Heart's Friend B",
            "jpText": "模擬レース控えてる子、励ましてあげるんだって！\nハートってば、アツくて、やさし～！",
            "enText": "Sounds like it's to cheer on the girls participating \nin the next mock race! Heart's so passionate and kind～!",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 219,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": 2439786586699902880,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ギャラリーを沸かせていたのは、華やかなチア集団だった。\n真ん中には、ひと際目を引くウマ娘の姿が――",
            "enText": "There was a group of flashy cheerleaders hyping up the crowd. \nAnd at the center of it all, the Uma Musume that drew my attention――",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 108,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "pathId": -6523885106625735828,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Hey, everyone!　盛り上がる準備はできてる？\n俯いてたらもったいないわ！　顔を上げて、look at me!",
            "enText": "Hey, everyone! Are you ready to get fired up? \nLooking down is such a waste! Raise your heads, look at me!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 263,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 36,
                    "pathId": -7272073082630599723
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 41,
                    "pathId": -8699912033359974965
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4952229815271507962,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Bad vibesなんて、ぜーんぶ吹き飛ばしちゃって！\nみんなで一緒に、heart beatを響かせましょっ♪",
            "enText": "Just let those bad vibes all get blown away! \nEveryone, all together, let our heart beats resonate♪",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 212,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（あれは……デアリングハート……）",
                    "enText": "(That's……Daring Heart……)",
                    "nextBlock": 9
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 210,
                    "pathId": -1057751247064741273
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": 9214858295919500289
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3090596388206224387,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "その道を行くならば知らぬ者はいない……\n名門ウマ娘育成クラブ“ヒルエスタ・アカデミー”出身のホープ。",
            "enText": "For those that walk this path, there were none that did not know…… \nFrom the prestigious \"Hilleasta Academy\", their ray of Hope.",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 110,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 27,
                    "pathId": 3023118489123705536
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 152,
                    "pathId": -747254366031561542
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -818439791074968632
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2658450743625336577,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "――今、多くの人からデビューを待ち望まれているウマ娘だ。",
            "enText": "――Now, many were eagerly awaiting her debut.",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 81,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 7108531645296146519
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1971518908105632232,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "みんな、私の思いつきに付き合ってくれてありがと！\n――……どう？　あなたも熱くなれた？",
            "enText": "Everyone, thanks for going along with my spur-of-the-moment idea. \n――……So, how was it? Are you all fired up now too?",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 233,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 88,
                    "pathId": -719587351534463853
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 27,
                    "pathId": -6869269509418905287
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -39247524167353518
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -9150128142307491264,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "レースを控えた友人",
            "enName": "Friend Entering the Race",
            "jpText": "うん……！　超元気出たよ！　ありがとうっ、ハート！！",
            "enText": "Yeah……! I'm feeling so much better! Thank you, Heart!",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 127,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 159,
                    "pathId": -9081213528683242063
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3269522451156818486,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "これほどの逸材だ。すでに優秀なトレーナーがついてるに違いない。\n自分の出る幕ではない――資料を抱えなおし、踵を返した時だった。",
            "enText": "With her exceptional talent, she must already have an \nexceptional trainer. There was no place for me here――As I \nreadjusted the documents I was carrying and turned to leave――",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 127,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 98,
                    "pathId": -516891071981259596
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 63,
                    "pathId": -8064334985799993651
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5803462042882011621,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "（びゅおおおお……っ！！）",
            "enText": "(Byuuoooooo……!!)",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 61,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（あぁっ、資料が……！）",
                    "enText": "(Ah, my documents……!)",
                    "nextBlock": 15
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": 5831676150594212342
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 35,
                    "pathId": 8592361563697469202
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3422158968681219531,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "……Are you okay?",
            "enText": "……Are you okay?",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 72,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 281,
                    "pathId": 5881376458830908545
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3190576509804899121,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "フフッ……情熱的なlove letterが飛んできたのかと思った。\n――……Huh?",
            "enText": "Fufuu……I thought a passionate love \nletter had come flying my way. ――……Huh?",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 317,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "あ、あの……それは……っ！",
                    "enText": "Ah, uh……that's……!",
                    "nextBlock": 17
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 52,
                    "pathId": 543510254229908770
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 77,
                    "pathId": 7759588631617177199
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3045333563148954884,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "……『脱力と爆発的トップスピードの相関性』？",
            "enText": "……『The Correlation Between Relaxation and Explosive Top Speed』?",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 163,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 174,
                    "pathId": 1230692011982242864
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 174,
                    "pathId": 7004237901759798847
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7565544210042061708,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "“空気抵抗を軽減しながら、無駄な動きを削ぎ落とし、\nインパクトの瞬間にエネルギーを爆発させる。これにより――”",
            "enText": "\"While minimizing air resistance, reducing excess motion――and at the \nmoment of impact, with an explosive burst of energy. By doing this――\"",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 294,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 349,
                    "pathId": 1719155334199271856
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 9051287582420358931
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1369219388357556680,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "“フィジカルのハンデを、カバーすることを期待する”……へえ、\nこれ、あなたが書いたの？　ものすごい熱量ね！",
            "enText": "\"This could help cover for any physical disadvantages.\" \n……Ohhhh, did you write this? There's quite the passion behind this.",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 378,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "机上の空論というか……勝手な分析で……",
                    "enText": "Just a bit of theorycrafting……speculation……",
                    "nextBlock": 20
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 162,
                    "pathId": -1105058732469514038
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 6718251003707414334
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 793762453700229330,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "そんなことないわ……とっても興味深い。\nフィジカル不利の押し負けが、回避できるかもってことでしょ？",
            "enText": "Not at all……it's really interesting. It's basically a way to avoid \ngetting overpowered and overcome a physical disadvantage, right?",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 246,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 182,
                    "pathId": -8722156710767672878
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 334,
                    "pathId": -6747007902790042622
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 197,
                    "pathId": -5097528692505796155
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4623546005039641815,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "……ね、これ、私に貸してくれない？",
            "enText": "……Hey, can you let me borrow this?",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 167,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "え……？",
                    "enText": "Eh……?",
                    "nextBlock": 22
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 146,
                    "pathId": 3167735122497438483
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -2700217924824868111
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 10,
                    "pathId": 2702163812341043983
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2933857154790873276,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "大丈夫よ。心配しなくても、ちゃんと返すから！\nそれも、I'll pay you back double……倍にしてね♪",
            "enText": "It'll be fine. Don't worry, I'll properly return it! \nAnd I'll pay you back double……on the double♪",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 269,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 129,
                    "pathId": 4842888278281460715
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 61,
                    "pathId": -7202870316935979360
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 197,
                    "pathId": -2042495613716985321
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1394284057042869514,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "かわりに、私が実践するところをあなたに見せてあげる！\n生きたデータをその目でゲットできるperfect chanceでしょ？",
            "enText": "In exchange, the moment I make it a reality, you'll \nget to see that! You'll get to see that data come \nin live, it's the perfect chance, don't you think?",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 314,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 66,
                    "pathId": 3587575000337806023
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 7751046760083902639
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 350,
                    "pathId": 7430544001349872276
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3390300435756180209,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "彼女の射抜くような瞳の輝きに、ハートがひとつ高鳴った。\nもし……本当に。自分の分析データが、役に立つのなら……――",
            "enText": "With just a look from her piercing blue eyes, my Heart skipped a beat. \nIf……she was serious, then, I can find out if my analysis is useful……――",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 119,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ああ……わかった、君に貸すよ！",
                    "enText": "Yeah……got it, you can borrow it!",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "うん……わかった、貴方に貸すよ！",
                    "enText": "Yeah……got it, you can borrow it!",
                    "nextBlock": 25
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 154,
                    "pathId": -4551865735394753269
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 350,
                    "pathId": -1989123821961055483
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6575358840351304132,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Thanks!　じゃあ明日の朝、一緒に走りに行きましょ♪",
            "enText": "Thanks! Then, tomorrow morning, let's go for a run together♪",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 149,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": -3315628451401771274
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 38,
                    "pathId": -8998481182831854102
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 11,
                    "pathId": -8249575836928633842
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2222793348618479307,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "See ya tomorrow, Mr. Audience!",
            "enText": "See ya tomorrow, Mr. Audience!",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 96,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 111,
                    "pathId": 680813595772595054
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4860523715865662484,
            "blockIdx": 26
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "See ya tomorrow, Ms. Audience!",
            "enText": "See ya tomorrow, Ms. Audience!",
            "nextBlock": 28,
            "origClipLength": 92,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 196,
                    "pathId": -2112254495570514554
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8711141253357742750,
            "blockIdx": 27
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Good morning!　データは、ちゃんと頭に入れてきたわ。\nさーて、あなたの理論で私はどうなっちゃうのかしら？",
            "enText": "Good morning! I've memorized all the data. \nAlright, using your theory, I wonder what'll happen?",
            "nextBlock": 29,
            "origClipLength": 299,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 99,
                    "pathId": 3502336431035786112
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -1213184718893811386
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6077242570787208262,
            "blockIdx": 28
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "タイム測定は、任せていい？",
            "enText": "Can I leave timekeeping to you?",
            "nextBlock": 30,
            "origClipLength": 77,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "あの……っ、一緒に走ってもいいかな？",
                    "enText": "Um……can I follow along?",
                    "nextBlock": 30
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 92,
                    "pathId": -105878266386520087
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 9088984171222143762,
            "blockIdx": 29
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "並走ってこと？　その自転車で？",
            "enText": "Like parallel running? With that bike?",
            "nextBlock": 31,
            "origClipLength": 100,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ああ……！君の走りを、近くで見たいんだ！",
                    "enText": "I want to see your running from up close!",
                    "nextBlock": 31
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "うん……！貴方の走りを、近くで見たいの！",
                    "enText": "I want to see your running from up close!",
                    "nextBlock": 31
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": 7002636810956059891
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 48,
                    "pathId": -8129460266064296468
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -350473030732178507,
            "blockIdx": 30
        },
        {
            "jpName": "デアリングハート",
            "enName": "Daring Heart",
            "jpText": "Okay!　もちろんいいわよ、よく見てって♪",
            "enText": "Okay! Of course it's fine, make sure you get a good look♪",
            "nextBlock": 32,
            "origClipLength": 122,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 115,
                    "pathId": -1037604995473915940
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -591844632733171903
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1226327844598175936,
            "blockIdx": 31
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "走り出した彼女は、一度も振り返らなかった。\n風を切り裂くように、鋭く、力強く――加速していく。",
            "enText": "After she started running, she never looked back. \nAs if tearing through the wind――sharp, powerful――she accelerated.",
            "nextBlock": 33,
